---
description: Require catalog-backed, locale-ready user-facing copy and stable UI text tests.
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `.agents/rules/internationalization.md` on every change to UI, user-visible API messages, or tests. Keep copy in `UI_STRINGS`, use complete messages with named `{{placeholder}}` interpolation, use active-locale `Intl` formatting, and update assertions to use catalog entries. Run `npm run check:i18n` while editing and the full quality gate before handoff.
